{#
  SAMPLE: robots.txt for projects using SEOMate (vaersaagod/seomate).
  SEOMate generates the sitemap but doesn't serve a robots.txt, so this template does.

  To use it: copy to templates/robots.txt.twig
    cp templates/_samples/seomate/robots.txt.twig templates/robots.txt.twig

  Craft serves templates/robots.txt.twig at /robots.txt as text/plain (the content type comes from the .txt extension).

  Crawlers are only allowed when CRAFT_DISALLOW_ROBOTS=false (production).
  config/general.php defaults disallowRobots to true, so a missing value blocks crawlers.

  - The Sitemap URL must match 'sitemapName' in config/seomate.php (default: sitemap → /sitemap.xml).
  - Never add a static web/robots.txt: the web server would serve it instead of this template.
  - Keep the output lines flush left (.vscode/settings.json maps robots.txt.twig to plaintext so the Twig formatter skips it).
#}
{%- if not craft.app.config.general.disallowRobots -%}
User-agent: *
Disallow: /cpresources/
Disallow: /vendor/
Disallow: /.env

Sitemap: {{ siteUrl('sitemap.xml') }}
{%- else -%}
User-agent: *
Disallow: /
{%- endif %}
